<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 72px', flexDirection: 'column', background: 'linear-gradient(160deg, #0B1220 0%, #16233D 100%)', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>
    {/* A 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 6 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 36, background: '#2AD4EE', marginTop: 5 }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 3, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>DESIGN POINT 04</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.38)', letterSpacing: 2, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>· 对应 ④ 记忆层</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ marginTop: 6, fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF9' }}>会话系统：追加日志，树形分叉</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* B 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 516, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 460, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 26 }}>

            {/* 左：存储模型 */}
            <Box style={{ width: 628, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 2.5, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>STORAGE · entry 追加</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.42)' }}>用户消息 / 助手消息 / 工具结果 / 压缩记录，都是一行</Text>
                </Box>

                <CodeBlock
                    code={`# session.jsonl  --  append-only, one entry per line
e01  user       "把导出功能改成 CSV"
e02  assistant  tool_call(read, {path: "export.ts"})
e03  tool       result( ok )
e04  assistant  tool_call(edit, {oldText: "xlsx", newText: "csv"})
e05  assistant  "改好了，已用 CSV 重写导出"

# 任何一条历史消息上都能分叉，像 git branch
              |
              +-- navigateTree(e02)  -> 长出新分支
                    e06  assistant  tool_call(edit, {流式写法})
                    e07  assistant  "换了个实现，行为一致"`}
                    language='bash'
                    width={628}
                    fontSize={12.5}
                    theme='github-dark'
                />

                <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 7 }}>
                    {[
                        ['追加-only', '好备份、好流式读取；不修改历史，只往后写'],
                        ['parent 指针', '每个 entry 记住父节点，树就自然长出来了'],
                        ['SQLite 可选', 'sessions / entries / branch_entries / writer_leases，带 FTS 全文搜索与写租约'],
                    ].map((r, i) => (
                        <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 4, background: '#2AD4EE', marginTop: 7 }} />
                            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 12.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.66)', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                                <span style={{ color: '#E8EEF9', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{r[0]}</span> · {r[1]}
                            </Text>
                        </Box>
                    ))}
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, paddingTop: 11, paddingBottom: 11, paddingLeft: 16, paddingRight: 16, background: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.07)', border: '1px solid rgba(42,212,238,0.22)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 2, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>价值</Text>
                    <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 13.5, color: '#E8EEF9', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                        线性会话出错只能重来；树形会话可以「回到岔路口」——不用重开会话、不用重述任务。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            {/* 右：两个 API 面 */}
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', paddingTop: 13, paddingBottom: 13, paddingLeft: 16, paddingRight: 16, background: 'rgba(22,35,61,0.72)', border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,249,0.10)', borderRadius: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 2, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>SessionManager · 五种姿势</Text>
                    <Box style={{ marginTop: 9, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5 }}>
                        {[
                            ['inMemory()', '内存会话，测试用'],
                            ['create(cwd)', '新建持久化会话'],
                            ['continueRecent()', '继续最近，没有则新建'],
                            ['list(cwd)', '列出全部（id + 首条摘要）'],
                            ['open(path)', '打开指定会话文件'],
                        ].map((r, i) => (
                            <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8 }}>
                                <Text style={{ width: 138, fontSize: 11.5, color: '#2AD4EE', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{r[0]}</Text>
                                <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.64)' }}>{r[1]}</Text>
                            </Box>
                        ))}
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', paddingTop: 13, paddingBottom: 13, paddingLeft: 16, paddingRight: 16, background: 'rgba(22,35,61,0.72)', border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,249,0.10)', borderRadius: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 2, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>Runtime · 四条替换路径</Text>
                    <Box style={{ marginTop: 9, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, flexWrap: 'wrap' }}>
                        {['newSession()', 'switchSession(file)', 'fork()', 'importFromJsonl()'].map((t, i) => (
                            <Box key={i} style={{ paddingTop: 4, paddingBottom: 4, paddingLeft: 8, paddingRight: 8, background: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.09)', borderRadius: 2 }}>
                                <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#2AD4EE', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{t}</Text>
                            </Box>
                        ))}
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ marginTop: 9, fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.66)', lineHeight: 1.58 }}>
                        四条路都先触发 session_before_switch / session_before_fork（可取消），再 teardown 当前会话。
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.78)', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        最容易漏的一步：替换后，所有会话级订阅与扩展绑定必须重新绑到 runtime.session。
                    </Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, paddingTop: 10, paddingBottom: 10, paddingLeft: 16, paddingRight: 16, background: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.06)', border: '1px solid rgba(42,212,238,0.18)', borderRadius: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#2AD4EE', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>LEASE</Text>
                    <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.70)' }}>exclusive 独占 / shared 共享附着：多端看同一会话不打架。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* C 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.42)' }}>从 LLM 到 Agent 再到 Pi Agent</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.42)', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>31 / 45</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
